sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Wisatawan
    participant UI as Browser / Frontend
    participant OC as OrderController
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant Storage as File Storage

    Wisatawan->>UI: Buka Form Pesan Tiket (/pemesanan/buat)
    UI->>OC: create(Request $request)
    OC->>DB: Query DestinationPrice::orderBy('destination_name')
    DB-->>OC: Data Destinasi & Harga
    OC-->>UI: Render View pemesanan.create
    
    Wisatawan->>UI: Input Destinasi, Tgl, Jml Tiket, Nama, WhatsApp
    Wisatawan->>UI: Klik 'Pesan Tiket Sekarang'
    UI->>OC: POST /pemesanan/simpan (Order Data)
    
    alt User Belum Login
        OC-->>UI: Redirect ke /login (Pesan Error)
    else User Terotentikasi
        OC->>OC: Generate booking_code ('VC-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXX')
        OC->>DB: Order::create([...])
        DB-->>OC: Record Order Tersimpan (Status: Menunggu Pembayaran)
        OC-->>UI: Redirect ke /pembayaran?booking=VC-...
    end

    Wisatawan->>UI: Mengunggah Resi Transfer Bank
    UI->>OC: POST /pembayaran/unggah-bukti (File Image)
    OC->>Storage: Pindahkan File ke /uploads/bukti-bayar
    Storage-->>OC: File Path String
    OC->>DB: Update orders (payment_proof, status = 'Menunggu Verifikasi')
    DB-->>OC: Status Berhasil Diperbarui
    OC-->>UI: Response Sukses & Update Tampilan